{
  "$schema": "../../../../../schemas/model.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "Notification, one in-app notification for one user (docs/seo_analyzer_PRD.md X10). Written by ISparkNotifier,",
    "never by a form; read only by its user (NotificationActions' row rule). \"live\": true on the type and both",
    "queries is how a new notification reaches an open UI: over /spark/live (X4), no second channel. The bell's",
    "unread count is UnreadNotifications' totalItems. expiresAfter is the retention (X1): an application changes it",
    "in its own model layer. UserId and ExpiresAtUtc are deliberately not attributes.",
    "",
    "HAND-AUTHORED. Ids are UUIDv5 of 'notifications:Notification[...]', written by 'npm run stamp:library-model-ids'."
  ],
